;; A user rule reacts to an error fact in-language: catch the location of any
;; division-by-zero error.  (Demonstrates the (error (error_spec ...)) surface.)
table (d int)
table (q int)
table (caught str)
facts
(d 0)
(d 5)
rule (d X) (= Y (/ 10 X)) --> (q Y)
rule (error (div_by_zero L A)) --> (caught L)
